uce Systemic Clearance of Etomidate in Children. <i>Anesthesia and analgesia 123(3):722–730</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1213/ANE.0000000000001477\">10.1213/ANE.0000000000001477</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/27537760\">27537760</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Shen_2016: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
